{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2023-04-25 08:00:00', 'title': "SYNOPSYS AND TSMC COLLABORATE TO JUMPSTART DESIGNS ON TSMC'S N2 PROCESS WITH OPTIMIZED EDA FLOWS", 'text': "ADOPTED BY LEADING COMPANIES, THE SYNOPSYS DIGITAL AND CUSTOM DESIGN FLOWS BOOST PERFORMANCE AND MINIMIZE POWER CONSUMPTION FOR ADVANCE D SOCS ON N3E AND N2 MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , APRIL 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN A CONTINUING EFFORT TO MEET STRINGENT DESIGN TARGETS FOR NEXT-GENERATION SYSTEM-ON-CHIPS (SOCS)\xa0SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ: SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION WITH TSMC TO DELIVER DIGITAL\xa0AND CUSTOM\xa0DESIGN EDA FLOWS ON TSMC'S MOST ADVANCED N2 PROCESS."}